mapping "d810.1" source="d810" target="SNOMED_CT:301442003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source d810 SNOMED CT 301442003 = ICF d8 education sub-activity of engaging in informal education
        (learning outside formal structures). Target, SE. The SNOMED CT concept covers the general
        education axis and does not distinguish informal/formal modality, so the target legitimately
        subsumes the source (broader); the informal-modality specificity is lost. Moderate tier per §1:
        solid topical match and SE-term alignment, but the informal-education specificity is not
        captured by the general educational-activities observable. Crosswalk-verified (sctid 301442003
        -> Athena 4103499).
        """
}
mapping "d810-d839.1" source="d810-d839" target="SNOMED_CT:301442003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source d810-d839 SNOMED CT 301442003 = ICF d8 chapter block spanning all education sub-activities
        (d810 informal, d815 preschool, d820 school, d825 vocational, d830 higher, d835
        education-around-life). Target, SE synonym. The SNOMED CT concept sits in the ICF-aligned
        functional-disability observable hierarchy (sibling to 286040004) and denotes the same education
        topic axis. SNOMED CT frames it as the ability-assessment rather than the activity itself, so the
        target subsumes the topic (broader), not a 1:1 exact equivalent. High tier per §1: tight SE-term
        alignment, verified crosswalk, one-level broader. Crosswalk-verified via sctid_to_athena_id.tdl
        -> Athena concept_id 4103499.
        """
}
mapping "d815.1" source="d815" target="SNOMED_CT:301442003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source d815 SNOMED CT 301442003 = ICF d8 education sub-activity of engaging in preschool education.
        Target, SE. The SNOMED CT concept is the general educational-activities observable with no
        preschool-level specificity; the target subsumes the source (broader) but loses the preschool
        life-stage specificity. Low tier per §1: topical match is real (preschool is an educational
        activity) but the equivalence is loose because the preschool/early-childhood specificity is
        absent on the SNOMED CT side. No preschool-specific SNOMED CT functioning observable exists.
        Crosswalk-verified (sctid 301442003 -> Athena 4103499).
        """
}
mapping "d820.1" source="d820" target="SNOMED_CT:301442003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source d820 SNOMED CT 301442003 = ICF d8 education sub-activity of engaging in school education
        (primary/secondary schooling). Target, SE. The SNOMED CT concept covers the general education axis
        and subsumes school education (broader); school-level specificity is partially captured since
        most commonly denotes school-based learning. Moderate tier per §1: clear topical and SE-term
        alignment, one-level broader, school is the prototypical educational activity.
        Crosswalk-verified (sctid 301442003 -> Athena 4103499).
        """
}
mapping "d825.1" source="d825" target="SNOMED_CT:301442003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source d825 SNOMED CT 301442003 = ICF d8 education sub-activity of engaging in vocational
        education/training. Target, SE. Vocational education is a subset of educational activities, so
        the target subsumes the source (broader), but the vocational/occupational-training specificity
        is lost. (The vocational-training *procedure* concepts 54106008/44943004 are interventions, not
        the activity of engaging as a learner, and sit on the wrong axis.) Low tier per §1: real topical
        overlap but loose equivalence due to lost vocational specificity. Crosswalk-verified (sctid
        301442003 -> Athena 4103499).
        """
}
mapping "d830.1" source="d830" target="SNOMED_CT:301442003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source d830 SNOMED CT 301442003 = ICF d8 education sub-activity of engaging in higher education
        (university/college). Target, SE. Higher education is a subset of educational activities, so the
        target subsumes the source (broader), but the higher-education/university-level specificity is
        lost. No higher-education-specific SNOMED CT functioning observable exists. Low tier per §1: real
        topical overlap but loose equivalence due to lost higher-education specificity.
        Crosswalk-verified (sctid 301442003 -> Athena 4103499).
        """
}
mapping "d835.1" source="d835" target="SNOMED_CT:301441005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source d835 SNOMED CT 301441005 = ICF d8 education sub-activity of engaging in life around
        education (the non-instructional aspects of educational life — using educational facilities,
        school-life participation). Target, SE synonym. The SNOMED CT concept sits in the same ICF-aligned
